                        "sense_id": "99d9b5da-b5ba-3380-9e76-302da0574a2d",
                        "entry_id": "4e2eaa9e-ddde-3d5d-bfc1-00b2efb3a47e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A crispy raw vegetable; an individual piece of crudités."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb639894-00ba-4469-b952-a3ae8d67ea8c",
                                "sense_id": "99d9b5da-b5ba-3380-9e76-302da0574a2d",
                                "text": "In its raw form, fennel might be eaten as a crudité along with a host of other local vegetables—radishes, sweet red onions, cucumber, artichoke, celery and tomatoes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d531ab9-ed07-3b6d-ab13-dc75e6cba7e6",
                        "entry_id": "4e2eaa9e-ddde-3d5d-bfc1-00b2efb3a47e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of crudités (“raw vegetables served as an appetizer”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df8a0425-cfa1-4121-b5e4-9d6d79a8346a",
                                "sense_id": "7d531ab9-ed07-3b6d-ab13-dc75e6cba7e6",
                                "text": "The note said that she and two of our friends were enjoying a bottle of perfectly chilled chinon, a plate of crudité, and some goat cheese, while gossiping about the wider circle to which we all in some way belonged."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db2e828c-f6ff-4e96-947c-4f3100d1b84b",
                                "sense_id": "7d531ab9-ed07-3b6d-ab13-dc75e6cba7e6",
                                "text": "When you're eating crudité, chips or anything else that uses a communal dip, you should dip before you take a bite."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd4cc371-f99c-4fae-9a98-06ee9d9f8b0d",
                                "sense_id": "7d531ab9-ed07-3b6d-ab13-dc75e6cba7e6",
                                "text": "The beautiful and often exotic produce available in farmers markets and specialty grocers today are a welcome addition to a crudité. Because they are to be consumed in their most unadorned state, freshness will more than make up for any[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfadd316-c99e-44f7-af52-cb5202b9e76a",
                                "sense_id": "7d531ab9-ed07-3b6d-ab13-dc75e6cba7e6",
                                "text": "Carrots and celery do not a crudité make; let your senses determine what vegetables and fruits should appear on your crudité tray."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
